 3 | #[bstack_block(rc)]
   | ^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^
   = note: `#[embed]` requires a plain `#[bstack_block]` / `#[bstack_enum]` (or a stdlib collection). A reference-counted `#[bstack_block(rc)]` / `(rc, weak)` block carries a refcount / separate control block that embedding would strand — hold it out-of-line with `#[bstack_owned]` (or `#[bstack_strong]`) instead.
   = help: the following other types implement trait `bstack_raii::__private::BStackEmbeddable`:
             BStackBTreeMap<K, V>
             BStackBTreeSet<K>
             BStackBinaryHeap<K, V>
             BStackBox<T>
             BStackCountingBloomFilter<K>
             BStackDeque<T>
             BStackHashMap<K, V>
             BStackHashSet<K>
           and $N others
